OL,3,AInvestigators face 'daunting' recovery
OL,4,Amission after Florida jet crash killed
OL,5,Anine
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS media have reported that one of the
OL,8,Fvictims was the plane's 20-year-old
OL,9,Fcopilot. No victims have been
OL,10,Fofficially named
OL,12,FSomeone on the ground near the crash
OL,13,Fsite sustained a leg injury, officials
OL,14,Ftell reporters
OL,16,FThe crash happened near Cresthaven,
OL,17,Fsome nine miles (14 km) from
OL,18,FMar-a-Lago, President Donald Trump's
OL,19,Fresort
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
